---
// A real 404 page. Without one, Cloudflare Pages falls back to serving
// index.html with a 200 for every unmatched path (soft-404), which wastes
// crawl budget and pollutes machine_events with phantom successes.
---

<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>기록 없음 | Ydnil-poh Archive</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --paper: #ede8de;
        --ink: #25231d;
        --muted: #6f6b60;
        --line: rgba(92, 83, 67, 0.2);
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        display: flex;
        font-family: "Inter", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", system-ui, sans-serif;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .empty-cell {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        max-width: 420px;
        padding: 44px 48px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 10px; }
      p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 24px; }
      a { color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="empty-cell">
      <h1>이 자리에는 기록이 없다</h1>
      <p>주소가 바뀌었거나, 아직 쓰이지 않았거나, 지워진 자리다.</p>
      <a href="/">필드로 돌아가기</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
